{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.71597818607575614,"y":0.052052987740183188,"w":0.2012382253011068,"h":0.020482289532500642,"c":1},{"y":0.10174418576476396,"t":"Ideas are presented logically. A range of good linking expressions are used [To","h":0.017570019769368228,"x":0.23356400847423098,"w":0.65224914550781254,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.67474049886067711,"x":0.23702421413796229,"t":"begin with | Moreover | On the other hand | Furthermore]. However, almost every","y":0.12063953460178345,"h":0.01756900269472994},{"w":0.67312627156575522,"c":1,"x":0.23524702459859081,"y":0.13652478542770874,"t":"sentence begins with a linking device which makes it quite mechanical. Generally,","h":0.020474389185014541},{"w":0.67128026326497392,"h":0.019065210917681652,"t":"reference and cohesion within sentences is well managed [which | it]. A reduction","y":0.15535339369985923,"x":0.23356402053014277,"c":1},{"w":0.68166091918945315,"t":"in the number of linking devices that come at the start of sentences would make it","x":0.2318339001431057,"h":0.019066227992320051,"c":1,"y":0.17424772546156342},{"y":0.19200617690088351,"x":0.2332778590793142,"t":"less formulaic.","h":0.017441053503956083,"w":0.12340390523274741,"c":1},{"y":0.21938418441545904,"x":0.23356400273241074,"t":"Vocabulary is well managed, with a good range of higher-level items, including","w":0.650519053141276,"h":0.018987908573564471,"c":1},{"w":0.61937718709309908,"y":0.2368789360942013,"h":0.018935017355511063,"c":1,"x":0.23529410518238231,"t":"collocation [pay...attention | capable of doing | a crucial part of]. There are"},{"c":1,"w":0.66448644002278645,"x":0.23523888649038213,"t":"occasional errors [till \/ to | focused at \/ focused on] that detract from the highest","y":0.25390290935743309,"h":0.020979492208855866},{"y":0.27466759998110635,"t":"scores. Grammatical structures are well presented, with a range of complex","w":0.62283737182617183,"c":1,"h":0.017494751574527623,"x":0.23356401296990537},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.29356193174318368,"w":0.57093424479166666,"x":0.23356401939900137,"c":1,"t":"structures, including multi clause sentences. A few errors do remain."},{"y":0.31976744157846548,"x":0.23529410655013464,"h":0.017531368930995495,"c":1,"t":"Overall, this is a very strong and articulate response. To achieve a higher score,","w":0.65051905314127612},{"c":1,"t":"the candidate could provide a conclusion that refers directly to the question, and","h":0.021618342549755809,"x":0.23347404137615022,"y":0.33533268856905574,"w":0.66972737630208334},{"c":1,"y":0.3559247575736928,"x":0.23350265661034256,"w":0.45169733683268232,"t":"avoid starting each sentence with a linking expression.","h":0.018955171984171293},{"w":0.031141869227091501,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"139","x":0.88062283698129551,"y":0.95348837215772475}]}